                                "sense_id": "cf2970fc-c196-3dff-89b3-40e42a62b108",
                                "text": "Durch der Straßen lange Zeile / Wächst es fort mit Windeseile, / Kochend wie aus Ofens Rachen / Glühn die Lüfte, Balken krachen",
                                "translation": "Through the streets' long lines it flies, / And with the wind in swiftness vies. / As from furnace jaws out-reeking, / Glows the hot air; beams are creaking",
